    <item>
      <title>智能之眼，推理之脑：AI如何重构小微金融的信任与未来</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/article-20250924104004988-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 24 Sep 2025 10:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
